# Keep android-tools-adbd from being enabled at boot.
#
# meta-oe's 98-android-tools-adbd.preset enables it in basic.target. On sol it
# must start only when usb-moded triggers it (adb_mode dyn-mode, appsync
# StartUnit). Started early, it races configfs_set_function(): adbd either
# fails to open ep0 before FunctionFS is mounted, or holds the abstract socket
# "local:5037" and blocks later restarts.
#
# Presets are read in lexicographic order, first match wins, so 10- beats 98-.
disable android-tools-adbd.service
